    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d338-a1">

                <pb facs="0570" n="470" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg470"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 131.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">royal decree</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Ultramar.</hi></placeName></dateline></opener>
                <p>In order to establish proper conditions of reciprocity between the commerce of
                    the island of Cuba and of the United States, and without prejudice to what may
                    be decided in the drawing up of tariffs under consideration for such island,
                    with a view to establish with urgency our commercial relations with that
                    Republic on a firm and equitable footing, and to harmonize all interests in
                    conformity with the report made by the section of ultramar of the council of
                    state, on the proposition of the minister of ultramar, and in accord with my
                    council of ministers, I hereby revoke article 5 of the royal decree of the 12th
                    of March, 1867, ordering that the merchandise proceeding from the United States
                    under the Spanish flag will pay, on its importation in the island of Cuba, the
                    duties named in the tariff on the same merchandise brought under a foreign flag,
                    which measure will take effect thirty days after the publication of this decree
                    by the consuls and vice-consuls of Spain in the official papers of their
                    respective districts.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given at the palace <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-12-26">this 26th of December, 1883</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>ALFONSO.</item>
                            <item>The Minister of Ultramar,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                    >Estanislao Suárez Inclán.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
